<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How Emily Hipkiss Counselling & Therapy handles your personal information.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p>This website is run by Emily Hipkiss, Counselling &amp; Therapy. This notice explains what happens to information you share through the site.</p>
      <h2>The contact form</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact form, your name, email address, phone number (if given) and message are sent to Emily by email so she can reply to you. They are not used for anything else and are not shared with anyone else.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This site does not use advertising cookies. [TODO: confirm whether any analytics are added at launch and update this line.]</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask what information is held about you, or ask for it to be deleted, by emailing <a href="mailto:emilyhipkisscounselling@outlook.com">emilyhipkisscounselling@outlook.com</a>.</p>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: [TODO: launch date]</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
